Provider retry advanced

This plugin is a derived work of the "Provider retry" plugin from BB
(https://github.com/get-bb/bb), directory plugins/provider-retry at tag
desktop-v0.46.1 (tree 411eac54ac16d0a3cb57d1de8396d37564884a73),
Copyright (c) 2026 Michael Yong, released under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Unchanged from upstream:
  src/retry-policy.ts, src/retry-contract.ts, src/queued-retries.ts,
  src/diagnostics.ts
Modified from upstream:
  server.ts: the stock overload/subscription-limit policy runs only for
    those failures, retries nothing before `arm` or on a held thread, and
    checks that gate again after the availability lookup; the availability
    answer is parsed with the schema the host validates with (inferring
    callRpc's output from it exceeds TypeScript's instantiation depth
    outside BB's own repository); connectivity (transport) failures are
    recovered by a fixed 60s scan that probes the provider path and asks
    core to retry natively; a message.dispatch hook stops this plugin's
    queued retries after a hold, cancel, stop or newer failure; a
    stalled-turn watchdog and two follow-ups (continuation check,
    unfinished request) keep stalled work moving without a person nudging
    it.
  src/cli.ts: command name, connectivity recovery, watchdog and follow-up
    state in `status`, `cancel` also stops recovery of the current failure,
    new `hold`, `release`, `scan`, `watchdog`.
  test/stock.test.ts, ported from server.test.ts to bun:test. Fork deltas
    are limited to: plugin id, the extra transportRecovery setting, the
    workflow recovery, stalled-turn watchdog and follow-up settings (each
    off by default), the extra CLI commands, the CLI name, the
    `connectivity` field in `status --json`, cancel's not-found message,
    the registered message.dispatch hook and its checks on this plugin's
    own retries, and every host being armed before load (a fresh, unarmed
    install retries nothing; see test/recovery.test.ts).
New in this fork:
  src/transport.ts, src/probe.ts, src/recovery.ts, test/fake-core.ts,
  src/watchdog.ts, src/continuations.ts, src/follow-ups.ts,
  test/recovery.test.ts, test/transport.test.ts, test/review-cases.test.ts, test/reviewer-refresh.test.ts,
  test/setup.ts, test/stall-and-follow-ups.test.ts, test/interrupted-workflows.test.ts,
  skills/provider-retry-advanced/SKILL.md

test/fake-core.ts restates BB core's retry rules from bb-app 0.46.1
(server/src/services/threads/turn-retry.ts, turn-failed.ts), same license.
The fork's additions are released under the same MIT License.

